<Item XName="Constants" UserName="Constants" Type="Equation">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>Fsignal = 10;&#x0009;% Frequency of the CW signal in GHz&#x000D;&#x000A;Farray  = 10;&#x0009;% Freq for the absolute spacing of the array elements, GHz&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;NumElements = 8;&#x0009;% NumElements across each row and column. Array will have total of NumElements*NumElements elements.&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;SpeedOfLight = 299792458; % meter/sec&#x000D;&#x000A;HalfWavelength = 0.5*SpeedOfLight/(Farray * 1e9);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;beamTheta = 20; %deg&#x000D;&#x000A;beamPhi = 0; %deg&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;PolOption = tune(0);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;EthetaEphiMagRatio = tune(10);&#x000D;&#x000A;EthetaEphiPhaseDiffDeg = tune(-90);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;Etheta = 1;&#x000D;&#x000A;Ephi = Etheta / EthetaEphiMagRatio * exp(j * EthetaEphiPhaseDiffDeg * pi / 180.0);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% Make real or imag part of Ephi 0 when EthetaEphiPhaseDiffDeg = n*90 &#x000D;&#x000A;% since due to numerical precision the above expression produces a &#x000D;&#x000A;% non-zero real or imag part on the order of 1e-18.&#x000D;&#x000A;if ( rem( EthetaEphiPhaseDiffDeg, 90 ) == 0 )&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;if ( mod( round( EthetaEphiPhaseDiffDeg/90 ), 2 ) == 1 )&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;&#x0009;Ephi = j*imag(Ephi);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;else&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;&#x0009;Ephi = real(Ephi);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;end&#x000D;&#x000A;end&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;RxTx = tune(2);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;IncidentEthetaEphiMagRatio = tune(1);&#x000D;&#x000A;IncidentEthetaEphiPhaseDiffDeg = tune(90);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;IncidentEtheta = 1;&#x000D;&#x000A;IncidentEphi = IncidentEtheta / IncidentEthetaEphiMagRatio * exp(j * IncidentEthetaEphiPhaseDiffDeg * pi / 180.0);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;% Make real or imag part of IncidentEphi 0 when IncidentEthetaEphiPhaseDiffDeg = n*90 &#x000D;&#x000A;% since due to numerical precision the above expression produces a &#x000D;&#x000A;% non-zero real or imag part on the order of 1e-18.&#x000D;&#x000A;if ( rem( IncidentEthetaEphiPhaseDiffDeg, 90 ) == 0 )&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;if ( mod( round( IncidentEthetaEphiPhaseDiffDeg/90 ), 2 ) == 1 )&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;&#x0009;IncidentEphi = j*imag(IncidentEphi);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;else&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;&#x0009;IncidentEphi = real(IncidentEphi);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x0009;end&#x000D;&#x000A;end&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;</Text>
